        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You resided in Hinji for a time, though you found yourself without a home due to a dependence on the drug called ice tears or other unfortunate circumstance. You spent much of your life on the docks and learned how to scrounge to survive.</p>\n<p>Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to <strong>Constitution</strong> or <strong>Wisdom</strong>, and one is a free attribute boost.</p>\n<p>You're trained in the Survival skill and the Fishing Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Forager] skill feat.</p>"
